  "name": "Spellfire Runes resets Smolder from Warpdagger and Runeblade (#13069)",
  "contract": [
    "Spellfire Runes 801511 (Runemaster) tooltips: Runeblade has a $802661h% (20%) chance and Warpdagger a $h%",
    "(100%) chance to reset the cooldown of Smolder and increase the damage of your next Smolder within $801512d",
    "(10 sec) by $801512s1% (20%). #13069 reports that Warpdagger applies the damage buff but leaves Smolder on",
    "cooldown, and that Runeblade never seemed to proc it. Smolder's ranks share category 2688 with a 6 second",
    "category cooldown; the Runemaster cast hook clears the cooldown of the Smolder rank the player owns and adds",
    "801512. This scenario reproduces the report on the highest rank (502630): after Smolder goes on cooldown, a",
    "Warpdagger cast must add the buff, clear the server cooldown and the cooldown the client shows, and let",
    "Smolder be cast again at once. Thirty Runeblade casts at 20% make at least one more buff near certain",
    "(0.8^30 is about 0.1%)."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
  "players": [
    {"id": "rune", "race": 1, "class": 32, "level": 80}
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {"id": "dummy", "owner": "rune", "entry": 36, "level": 80, "health": 5000000, "distance": 3}
